  "lede": {
    "zh": "编码 agent 里面是什么？从一次模型调用开始，亲手决定它看到什么、能做什么、什么时候算做完：先替它拿文件，再让它自己读、自己找、改到测试通过。最后搭出的，是一个自己接 issue、自己修好的 agent。",
    "en": "What is inside a coding agent? Starting from one model call, you decide what it sees, what it may do and when it is done: first you fetch its files, then it reads and looks for itself, and goes on until the tests pass. What you end up with is an agent that takes an issue and fixes it on its own."
  },
